            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieves details of contract seat holders including name, email, and unique ID.\nFor more information, refer to the [Recruiter Seatholders documentation](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/linkedin/talent/recruiter-system-connect/recruiter-prospect-interactions/recruiter-seatholders).",
